 instant bike  upgrades for speed defense and trouble  and early access to the drift of  crossbow all these items and upgrades  are available in-game but of course will  take us a little bit more time to unlock  in terms of versions of days gone you  have a few to choose from the base game  is always a good option but there's also  a digital deluxe edition which comes  with music and an art book three bike  skins early access to the monkey wrench  skill and the ps4 dynamic theme physical  versions include the special edition  with all the previous items but in real  life you can touch it with your hands  and finally the collector's edition has  everything we've mentioned plus a patch  for a biker jacket for decals six  collectors pin badges and a statue of  deacon looking like he's going to drop  the best rap album of the apocalypse and  that's everything 30 things you should  know about days gone oh one more thing  actually days gone releases on April  26th worldwide that's a Friday if you  need to take a day off work off pretend  to be on weld to get the day off school  your secret is safe with me  I'm Adam from PlayStation granade it's  been an absolute pleasure I'll see you  next time  you

